  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the truck. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2016-2023 Toyota Tacoma (Excl. Trail Edition) with Deck Rail System\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nCompatibility: YITAMOTOR soft roll up tonneau cover is compatible with the 5'/60.5\" bed of 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 Toyota Tacoma with deck rail system(Excl. Trail Edition).\nPainless Operation: No-drill clamps fasten the tonneau cover rails to your truck bed; Hassle-free installation with instructions and mounting hardware included; Access the entire bed by simply rolling the cover up to bulkhead\nWater-Repellent: Arched crossbars are specially designed to enable water flow off the surface, preventing water accumulation and potential damage caused by the extra weight\nQuality That Lasts: Double-layer PVC cover resists tear and abrasion for long-lasting use; Sturdy aluminum framework and side rails work seamlessly with stainless steel clamps to create a strong and secure seal\nTension & Latch System: Reliable spring latching system pairs with an adjustable tension system to maintain a tight and even fit, preventing the cover from getting wrinkles or folds so you enjoy all-around protection regardless of inclement weather .",
